:: Flats Hookah Work Friendly Window
<<effects>>

The three customers smoke until their arms go slack and the hoses rest against their chests. Once their breathing settles, you move to the window and watch the traffic below while keeping them in view.
<br><br>

<<if (dangerEvent() or $eventforced)>>
	A figure on the pavement below has stopped beneath a streetlight. Their face is turned towards your window. When you shift to one side, their head follows the movement.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[커튼을 친다|Flats Hookah Work Window Close]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[마주 쳐다본다|Flats Hookah Work Window Stare]]>><<if $awareness lt 600>><<awareness 6>><</if>><</link>><<ggstress>><<if $awareness lt 600>><<gawareness>><</if>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[다음|Flats Hookah Work Simple Good End]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Flats Hookah Work Window Close
<<effects>>

당신은 커튼을 친다. 걱정거리는 이미 충분하다.
<br><br>

한 시간이 끝나갈 무렵, 당신은 손님들을 깨운다.
<br><br>

"정말 굉장했어요." <<person2>><<person>>【이가】 말한다. "한 시간 더 하고 싶어요."
<br><br>
<<speechresolve>>
	<<if ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "shy"))>>
		"I'm sorry," you say. "But it really isn't safe to spend more than an hour a day on the hookah. I hope you come back another time!"
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"I'm sorry," you say gently. "But it's not safe to spend more than an hour a day on the hookah. I hope you come back another time."
	<<elseif ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant"))>>
		"I'm sorry," you say. "But it isn't safe to spend more than an hour a day on the hookah. Please do come back another time."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Sorry," you say. "One hour a day is the limit. It's safer that way. Come back another time."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		"No," you say. "One hour a day is the limit. Try again another time."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
		"Sorry," you say. "One hour a day. That's the limit. Come back another time."
	<<else>>
		"죄송합니다." 당신이 말한다. "하지만 물담배를 하루에 한 시간 이상 하는 것은 안전하지 않아요. 다음에 또 오시길 바랄게요!"
	<</if>>
